  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like lesser angelic aspect, except you gain lowlight\nvision; darkvision 60 feet; DR 10/evil; immunity to acid, cold,\nand petrification; resistance to electricity 10 and fire 10; a +4 racial\nbonus on saves against poison; and protective aura and truespeech\nas supernatural abilities for the duration of the spell. Also, your\nwings give you a fly speed of 60 feet with good maneuverability.\n\nProtective aura provides a +4 deflection bonus to AC and a +4\nresistance bonus on saving throws against attacks made or effects\ncreated by evil creatures to anyone within 20 feet. Otherwise,\nit functions as a magic circle against evil and a lesser globe of\ninvulnerability, both with a radius of 20 feet.\n\nTruespeech allows you to speak with any creature that has a\nlanguage, as though using the tongues spell.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like lesser angelic aspect, except you gain lowlight\\nvision; darkvision 60 feet; dr 10/evil; immunity to acid, cold,\\nand petrification; resistance to electricity 10 and fire 10; a +4 racial\\nbonus on saves against poison; and protective aura and truespeech\\nas supernatural abilities for the duration of the spell. also, your\\nwings give you a fly speed of 60 feet with good maneuverability.\\n\\nprotective aura provides a +4 deflection bonus to ac and a +4\\nresistance bonus on saving throws against attacks made or effects\\ncreated by evil creatures to anyone within 20 feet. otherwise,\\nit functions as a magic circle against evil and a lesser globe of\\ninvulnerability, both with a radius of 20 feet.\\n\\ntruespeech allows you to speak with any creature that has a\\nlanguage, as though using the tongues spell.\"",
